  "amendmentMotionNotes": "<p>Baroness Stedman-Scott moved that this House regrets that the Universal Credit, Personal Independence Payment, Jobseeker&rsquo;s Allowance and Employment and Support Allowance (Decisions and Appeals) (Amendment) Regulations 2026 will result in claimants receiving payments without the appropriate reviews having taken place and fail to reduce the overall benefits bill. The House divided:</p>",
